<title>USA: Plymouth sees moderate Brite-Line losses.</title>
<headline>Plymouth sees moderate Brite-Line losses.</headline>
<dateline>CANTON, Mass. 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Plymouth Rubber Co Inc said Monday it expects moderate losses from its Brite-Line Technologies Inc subsidiary in the first several months of 1997 due to the highly seasonal nature of the pavement marking business.</p>
<p>Plymouth reported first-quarter net income of $141,000, or $0.06 per share, down from $305,000, or $0.14 a share, in the same period a year ago.</p>
</text>
